  "collectionNotes": [
    "部分适配：真实芯片、明确容量版本、BOOT和RGB数字通路；完整应用、无线、模拟电源及实物验收未完成。",
    "原生厂家模型与原始来源保持原尺寸/字节；电路版次和机械版次关系未确认，不能视为装配尺寸验收。",
    "Current official overview explicitly statesESP32-C6FH8 and8MiB. The retained official schematic explicitly statesESP32-C6FH4 and4MiB. Both source-backed capacity profiles are exposed; there is no proven V1/V2 sale designation or release date.",
    "The two exact sale SKUs27035/26976 are counted once each. Four product profiles distinguish two documented capacities and two header options, without inventing extra SKUs.",
    "All original native116/118 CAD components remain unscaled. Exact electrical revision/CAD match is unverified; native package geometry does not establish embedded flash capacity.",
    "Fixed official Basic Kit repository has noBIN file; linkedBLEAssist is an Android APK. No full ESP image/default has been fabricated. Digital native regressions are not official application acceptance."
  ]
